@host = http://localhost:8001

### Tillar ro'yxati
GET {{host}}/languages

### === words: qidirish ===

### Matn boshlanishi bo'yicha qidirish (en)
GET {{host}}/words?q=ecology&language=en

### Faqat uz so'zlar orasidan qidirish
GET {{host}}/words?q=hayd&language=uz

### Til filtrisiz qidirish (en+uz aralash)
GET {{host}}/words?q=day

### Sahifalash (limit/offset)
GET {{host}}/words?limit=5&offset=10

### limit maksimal chegaradan oshsa (422 kutiladi, le=200)
GET {{host}}/words?limit=500

### === words: id bo'yicha ===

### en so'z (ta'rif + misol + uz tarjima bilan)
GET {{host}}/words/1

### uz so'z (tarjimasi bo'sh, chunki bu allaqachon "to" tomon)
GET {{host}}/words/5190

### bir nechta turga ega so'z (masalan "update" - noun/verb)
GET {{host}}/words?q=update&language=en

### mavjud bo'lmagan so'z (404 kutiladi)
GET {{host}}/words/999999

### === courses / chapters / units ===

### Kurslar ro'yxati (Beginner, Essential)
GET {{host}}/courses

### Beginner kursining boblari
GET {{host}}/courses/1/chapters

### Essential kursining boblari
GET {{host}}/courses/2/chapters

### Bobning unitlari
GET {{host}}/chapters/1/units

### Unit ichidagi so'zlar (dars mazmuni)
GET {{host}}/units/1/words

### mavjud bo'lmagan unit (bo'sh ro'yxat kutiladi, 404 emas)
GET {{host}}/units/999999/words

### === stories ===

### Hikoyalar ro'yxati
GET {{host}}/stories?limit=5

### Bitta hikoya
GET {{host}}/stories/1

### mavjud bo'lmagan hikoya (404 kutiladi)
GET {{host}}/stories/999999

### === get_vocab: 0-based indeks bo'yicha to'liq vocab yozuvi (0..5199) ===

### birinchi yozuv
GET {{host}}/get_vocab?id=4128

### oxirgi yozuv (jami 5200 ta, 0..5199)
GET {{host}}/get_vocab?id=5199

### o'rtadagi bir yozuv
GET {{host}}/get_vocab?id=2500

### chegaradan tashqari (404 kutiladi)
GET {{host}}/get_vocab?id=5200

### manfiy id (422 kutiladi)
GET {{host}}/get_vocab?id=-1
